h2. Problem Summary

*Issue*: Growth automation strategies using {{MatchDatesToSpendPeriodAction}} incorrectly add enrollment duration twice when recalculating holdout parameters.

*Impact*: Holdout {{duration_sec}} increases incorrectly after the strategy run.

*Affected*: All growth automation strategies with holdouts.

h2. Example Case

*Bulk Group ID*: [1638414|https://admin-panel.bolt.eu/campaign-import/bulkGroups?id=1638414]

*Initial State*:

{code:json}{
  "duration_sec": 15552000,            // 180 days (0 holdout period + 180 enrollment duration)
  "enrollment_duration_sec": 15552000  // 180 days
}{code}

*Progression*:

* *Initial*: {{duration_sec: 15552000}} (0 holdout period + 180 enrollment duration) ✓
* *After running the action*: {{duration_sec: 31104000}} (180 holdout period + 180 enrollment duration) ✗

h2. Root Cause: Semantic Contract Mismatch

h3. ⚠️ The Core Issue: {{duration_sec}} Means Different Things

The field {{duration_sec}} has *two different semantic meanings* depending on context:

||Context||Meaning of {{duration_sec}}||Location||
|*Stored Holdout*|*Total duration* = holdout period + enrollment duration|{{holdout.options.duration_sec}}|
|*API Input*|*Holdout period only* (enrollment added by API)|{{calculateHoldoutEnd({ duration_sec })}}|

This *semantic ambiguity* creates a contract mismatch where the same field name represents different values.

h3. The Flow (Using Example Template Data)

*Initial Creation* ([DeliveryService.ts:323|https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/blob/bacc759b1d59dbeb2fbdfaef0feb831f98844491/src/platform/campaign/campaign_bulk_import/main/service/delivery/DeliveryService.ts#L323]):

{noformat}// Stores TOTAL duration (holdout period + enrollment)
holdoutPeriod = 0  // No holdout period
enrollmentDuration = 15552000  // From bundle (180 days)
   
duration_sec: 0 + 15552000 = 15552000  // Total
enrollment_duration_sec: 15552000{noformat}

*Recalculation* ([MatchDatesToSpendPeriodAction.ts:139)|https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/blob/bacc759b1d59dbeb2fbdfaef0feb831f98844491/src/platform/campaign/campaign_operations/main/templates/actions/MatchDatesToSpendPeriodAction.ts#L137]: 

{noformat}// Extracts stored TOTAL duration (15552000)
return holdout.options.duration_sec;  
// ✗ PROBLEM: Treats 15552000 (total) as if it's holdout-period-only (0){noformat}

*API Call* ([calculateHoldoutEnd.ts:23|https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/blob/6074f2138a8f93e9c12199b1d8df038d1b1ad36f/src/platform/campaign/campaign_holdouts/main/service/calculateHoldoutEnd.ts#L23]):

{noformat}// Expects HOLDOUT PERIOD duration (0), but receives TOTAL (15552000)
duration_sec: input.duration_sec              + enrollmentDuration
//            ↓ (total, not holdout period!)  ↓
//            15552000                        + 15552000 = 31104000 ✗
//            
// Should have been: 0 + 15552000 = 15552000 ✓{noformat}

